message: "If you use this software or the released result artifacts, please cite the paper."
title: "CPIS: Confidence Portability Under Inference Shift"
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations and frozen result artifacts for a study of whether a
  confidence-threshold decision policy selected under one inference
  configuration remains statistically reliable when decoding settings change.
